 "text": "Hey there, how are you? Great plan. Pick a spot that's lovely but not busy, and check with her if it's okay. Often a nice river bank or a large park. Then a sun dripping tree with those as treats is perfect. A blanket, packed lunch, towel and water bottle are essential. Keep it simple. Pop a small audiobook on your phone if you like, or just say it' a surprise date with music in the background. Then maybe just a text the night before to say the area is ready and you be there. No one will know until you turn up.",
